{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc1b Bugs are everywhere!<br>It's time to clean them up! Build your team or go solo\u2014stop this invasion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd25 Burn them with the blowtorch!<br>Use the power of fire to burn the invaders to a crisp!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd9f Spray them with the pesticide machine!<br>Force the bugs to disappear into the toxic mist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf00 Vacuum them up with the vacuum cleaner!<br>Suck them all up in one go and leave behind a pristine area!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc31 Detect bugs with your trained cat, Sniffers!<br>Sniffers can sense bugs in any area it sniffs! With its warnings, every corner is ready to be cleaned. A fast and reliable helper\u2014always by your side on this mission!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc63 Squish bugs with your hands, stomp them mercilessly with your feet!<br>Sometimes, getting the job done means squishing bugs in one swipe with your hands and stomping them with your feet\u2014end for the bugs, relaxation for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfaf Chaotic missions, absurd humor, fun cleaning!<br>Ready for the craziest cleaning experience, solo or with your team!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3557530?t=1743190824","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557530/7c4e2fc7545ddbfee44ca36b6d7c5883c03ee480/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743190824","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557530/ca1e56ffed8766692569450f5a9b174f7d11d94e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743190824","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557530/ca1e56ffed8766692569450f5a9b174f7d11d94e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743190824","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"descri